			"notes": "## v1.1.1\n\n### Fixed\n- The Ping-Wheel hook can no longer stop the game from launching. Ping-Wheel has no public API, so this addon injects into it; if that method ever changes, the injection now fails quietly and the integration turns itself off instead of halting startup.\n\n### Changed\n- The homepage and the bug-report link shown in the mod list now point at the CurseForge page. The message logged when Xaero's internal API changes points there too."
